  "description": "PromptPanel (项目快贴) is an open-source, local-first native macOS prompt manager, AI prompt launcher, and snippet launcher for ChatGPT, Claude, Cursor, Copilot, VS Code, Terminal, browser, and ordinary text-field workflows. It stores reusable prompts, code snippets, templates, and instructions locally in SQLite, opens a keyboard-first global hotkey panel, writes selected content to the clipboard first, and attempts automatic paste through macOS Accessibility when allowed.",
